*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
*%
*% PPD for the free Pantum M6500/M6507 CUPS filter (rastertopantum).
*% Written from the documented ZjStream/JBIG job format, not derived from
*% the vendor PPD.  See notes/print-protocol.md.
*%
*% The NickName deliberately differs from the vendor one ("Pantum M6500
*% Series") so both queues can coexist on the same machine.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*LanguageVersion: English
*Manufacturer: "Pantum"
*PCFileName: "M6500OP.PPD"
*Product: "(Pantum M6500 Series)"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*ModelName: "Pantum M6500 Series"
*ShortNickName: "M6500 Series open"
*NickName: "Pantum M6500 Series, rastertopantum"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertopantum"
*cupsVersion: 1.4
*cupsModelNumber: 6500

*% The vendor filter picks its output branch from this string.  Our filter
*% has the M6500 branch (PLATFORM_M, plain ZjStream, no PJL and no ACL)
*% built in, but the entry is kept so the PPD stays self-describing and so
*% the vendor binary would also do the right thing with it.
*cupsIPPReason PlatForm/PlatForm: "text:PLATFORM_M"
*End

*% Shown while the printer waits for the operator to turn the stack over.
*cupsIPPReason MDuplex/M: "text:Manual%20duplex:%20take%20the%20stack%20out%20of%20the%20output%20tray,
text:turn%20it%20over%20and%20put%20it%20back%20printed%20side%20down.
text:Do%20not%20remove%20any%20blank%20sheets.%20Then%20press%20the%20OK%20button."
*End

*% ==== Device capabilities ====
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Pantum;MDL:M6500 series;"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "22"
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*VariablePaperSize: True
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*Protocols: BCP

*% Only 600x600 is ever put on the wire; the "1200 dpi" mode below is a
*% two-bit halftone at the same hardware resolution.
*DefaultResolution: 600dpi

*% ==== Paper handling ====
*HWMargins: 14.17 14.17 14.17 14.17
*MaxMediaWidth: "618"
*MaxMediaHeight: "1021"
*LeadingEdge Short: ""
*DefaultLeadingEdge: Short

*OpenGroup: PaperGroup/Paper
*OpenUI *PageSize/Paper Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 60.0 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize Letter/Letter (8.5 x 11): "<</PageSize [612 792]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A4/A4 (210 x 297mm): "<</PageSize [595 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A5/A5 (148 x 210mm): "<</PageSize [420 595]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize A6/A6 (105 x 148mm): "<</PageSize [298 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B5/JIS B5 (182 x 257mm): "<</PageSize [516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize ISOB5/ISO B5 (176 x 250mm): "<</PageSize [499 709]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize B6/B6 (125 x 176mm): "<</PageSize [354 499]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Executive/Executive (7.25 x 10.5): "<</PageSize [522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Statement/Statement (5.5 x 8.5): "<</PageSize [396 612]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Folio/Folio (8.5 x 13): "<</PageSize [612 936]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Oficio/Oficio (216 x 343mm): "<</PageSize [612 972]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Legal/Legal (8.5 x 14): "<</PageSize [612 1008]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Postcard/Postcard (100 x 148mm): "<</PageSize [283 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize JapanesePostcard/Postcard (148 x 200mm): "<</PageSize [420 567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
