*PageSize Big16K/Big 16K (195 x 270mm): "<</PageSize [553 765]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize 32K/32K (130 x 185mm): "<</PageSize [369 524]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Big32K/Big 32K (135 x 195mm): "<</PageSize [383 553]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize ZL/ZL (120 x 230mm): "<</PageSize [340 652]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvMonarch/Monarch Env (3.875 x 7.5): "<</PageSize [279 540]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvDL/DL Env (110 x 220mm): "<</PageSize [312 624]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvC5/C5 Env (162 x 229mm): "<</PageSize [459 649]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize EnvC6/C6 Env (114 x 162mm): "<</PageSize [323 459]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Com10Envelope/No.10 Env (4.125 x 9.5): "<</PageSize [297 684]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Yougata2/Yougata2 (114 x 162mm): "<</PageSize [323 459]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Yougata4/Yougata4 (105 x 235mm): "<</PageSize [298 666]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Younaga3/Younaga3 (120 x 235mm): "<</PageSize [340 666]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Nagagata3/Nagagata3 (120 x 235mm): "<</PageSize [340 666]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

