*PageRegion B5/JIS B5 (182 x 257mm): "<</PageSize [516 729]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion ISOB5/ISO B5 (176 x 250mm): "<</PageSize [499 709]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion B6/B6 (125 x 176mm): "<</PageSize [354 499]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Executive/Executive (7.25 x 10.5): "<</PageSize [522 756]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Statement/Statement (5.5 x 8.5): "<</PageSize [396 612]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
