*PageRegion Postcard/Postcard (100 x 148mm): "<</PageSize [283 420]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion JapanesePostcard/Postcard (148 x 200mm): "<</PageSize [420 567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
