*PageRegion 32K/32K (130 x 185mm): "<</PageSize [369 524]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Big32K/Big 32K (135 x 195mm): "<</PageSize [383 553]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion ZL/ZL (120 x 230mm): "<</PageSize [340 652]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvMonarch/Monarch Env (3.875 x 7.5): "<</PageSize [279 540]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvDL/DL Env (110 x 220mm): "<</PageSize [312 624]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion EnvC5/C5 Env (162 x 229mm): "<</PageSize [459 649]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
